      {
        "id": "f1",
        "question": "Can I order prescription medicines directly through this website?",
        "answer": "No. This website does not sell prescription medicines online. You can send a clear photo or PDF of a valid prescription in WhatsApp. The pharmacist will review it and confirm availability and dispensing details.",
        "enabled": true
      },
      {
        "id": "f2",
        "question": "How do I send my prescription?",
        "answer": "Choose the prescription request option and continue to WhatsApp. When the chat opens, attach a clear photo or PDF of your valid prescription and send it to the pharmacy team.",
        "enabled": true
      },
      {
        "id": "f3",
        "question": "Are prescription medicine prices shown here?",
        "answer": "No. Prescription medicines are not listed with prices and cannot be checked out online. The pharmacy team will review the valid prescription and discuss availability directly.",
        "enabled": true
      },
      {
        "id": "f4",
        "question": "Can I ask for home delivery?",
        "answer": "Yes, you can ask the pharmacy to check your locality and available delivery slots. Coverage and timing are confirmed by the store team.",
        "enabled": true
      },
      {
        "id": "f5",
        "question": "Are the products with prices prescription medicines?",
        "answer": "No. Prices are shown only for the listed non-prescription health-care essentials and devices. Product availability and current prices should be confirmed with the store.",
        "enabled": true
      },
      {
        "id": "f6",
        "question": "Can the pharmacy provide medical advice through WhatsApp?",
